# ============================================================
# IMPORTANT: Repo only hosts website source files.
# All Python/PowerShell helper scripts, one-off generators,
# temp copies, and local audit/research files MUST stay local.
# Reference: ~/.claude/projects/.../memory/no-website-unrelated-files-to-github.md
